%% ===========================================================================
%% 2. Current beta execution flow
%% ===========================================================================
flowchart TD
    U[User uploads CV] --> EX[Extract text]
    EX --> PR[Build candidate profile]
    PR --> TR{Target role or<br/>detected roles?}
    TR -->|No| ERR[422 Ask for target role]
    TR -->|Yes| SC[Scan job sources<br/>SERIAL - bottleneck]
    SC --> NM[Normalize + quality check]
    NM --> SCO[Score each job - rules engine]
    SCO --> TH{Above threshold?}
    TH -->|Yes| M[Matches]
    TH -->|No| GATE[Relevance gate]
    GATE --> NEAR[Near matches]
    M --> OUT[Results + diagnostics]
    NEAR --> OUT
    OUT --> DASH[Save to dashboard]

