    Q -->|Few real jobs| D3[Blocker 3:<br/>scraping sources]
    Q -->|Two scoring paths| D6[Blocker 6:<br/>job-fit not wired]

    D1 --> A1[Action: Promise.allSettled<br/>+ per-source timeout]
    D6 --> A6[Action: wire job-fit.mjs<br/>as evaluator entry]
    D2 --> A2[Action: Phase 0 embeddings POC<br/>offline compare only]
