    A1 --> NEXT1[Next: unify scoring path]
    A6 --> NEXT2[Next: embeddings POC]
    A2 --> NEXT3[Next: semantic reranking<br/>behind feature flag]
    A3 --> NEXT4[Next: Phase B]

